hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1582","Ali bin Khashram told us, Issa bin Yunus told us, on the authority of Al-Amash, on the authority of Abu Salih, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, was He, peace and blessings of God be upon him, teaches us, saying: “When the imam says takbeer, say takbeer, and when he recites, not those upon whom anger is wrathed or those who have gone astray, say: Amen.”"
